{"assets":["/statement-assets/c9e2b2732ea2b9958e59be69df3fc096de0124c700d8ae87fa53e78a008fc2e7.png","/statement-assets/720c34d499940023e7433414f73e6db19900081ea800c91c743eedc553d354b7.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"505","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Mr. Kitayuta's Technology"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Shuseki Kingdom is the world's leading nation for innovation and technology. There are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" cities in the kingdom, numbered from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Thanks to Mr. Kitayuta's research, it has finally become possible to construct teleportation pipes between two cities. A teleportation pipe will connect two cities unidirectionally, that is, a teleportation pipe from city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" to city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y"},{"kind":"text","text":" cannot be used to travel from city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y"},{"kind":"text","text":" to city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":". The transportation within each city is extremely developed, therefore if a pipe from city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" to city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y"},{"kind":"text","text":" and a pipe from city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y"},{"kind":"text","text":" to city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"z"},{"kind":"text","text":" are both constructed, people will be able to travel from city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x"},{"kind":"text","text":" to city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"z"},{"kind":"text","text":" instantly."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Mr. Kitayuta is also involved in national politics. He considers that the transportation between the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" pairs of city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(ai, bi)"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ i ≤ m"},{"kind":"text","text":") is important. He is planning to construct teleportation pipes so that for each important pair "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(ai, bi)"},{"kind":"text","text":", it will be possible to travel from city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" to city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":" by using one or more teleportation pipes (but not necessarily from city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":" to city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":"). Find the minimum number of teleportation pipes that need to be constructed. So far, no teleportation pipe has been constructed, and there is no other effective transportation between cities."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2 ≤ n ≤ 105, 1 ≤ m ≤ 105"},{"kind":"text","text":"), denoting the number of the cities in Shuseki Kingdom and the number of the important pairs, respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The following "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines describe the important pairs. The "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th of them ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ i ≤ m"},{"kind":"text","text":") contains two space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ai, bi ≤ n, ai ≠ bi"},{"kind":"text","text":"), denoting that it must be possible to travel from city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" to city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":" by using one or more teleportation pipes (but not necessarily from city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":" to city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":"). It is guaranteed that all pairs "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(ai, bi)"},{"kind":"text","text":" are distinct."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the minimum required number of teleportation pipes to fulfill Mr. Kitayuta's purpose."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 5\n1 2\n1 3\n1 4\n2 3\n2 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 6\n1 2\n1 4\n2 3\n2 4\n3 2\n3 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the first sample, one of the optimal ways to construct pipes is shown in the image below: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/c9e2b2732ea2b9958e59be69df3fc096de0124c700d8ae87fa53e78a008fc2e7.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the second sample, one of the optimal ways is shown below: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/720c34d499940023e7433414f73e6db19900081ea800c91c743eedc553d354b7.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"505D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/505/problem/D"}